 "verdict": "ATTENTION IS NECESSARY, CORPUS DETERMINES: all 3 attention-free models are Pile-trained and NONE has the attractor (top-1 10.7-17.7%), while every attention model on the same corpus does (74.4-98.0%). Among ATTENTION models the corpus separates them -- gpt-neo-125M and gpt2 share an identical tokenizer and differ only in corpus, 78.1% vs 20.4%. This supersedes the single-factor 'corpus refuted' reading: mamba's negative was confounded by architecture, exactly as F63 disclosed.",
